@startuml
title Project change 与 ARSU revision patch
skinparam shadowing false
start
if (Stable research meaning changes?) then (yes)
  :Create change.md and optional design/tasks/delta;
  :Human accepts, rejects, defers or supersedes;
  if (accepted?) then (yes)
    :Explicitly edit owning stable spec;
    :Validate target and cross-references;
    :Mark change applied;
  else (no)
    :Keep stable specs unchanged;
  endif
else (manuscript operations)
  :Produce ARSU revision_patch outside researchspec/;
  :Optionally invoke stateless helper with explicit paths;
  :Validate all operations before atomic output;
endif
stop
@enduml
